    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Honda's (1971) 3D local orthonormal frame rotation recursion (`_honda_local_frame`, `grow_honda_1971_3d_tree`, L91-222), 4-archetype 3D crown morphospace (`evaluate_honda_3d_archetypes`, L225-250), Honda & Fisher's (1978) 5-whorl horizontal tier disk-union effective leaf area functional and 2D (theta_1, theta_2) optimization landscape (`grow_honda_fisher_planar_tier`, `compute_effective_leaf_area_ratio`, `evaluate_honda_fisher_optimization_surface`, L256-430), and Leonardo da Vinci / Shinozaki pipe-model diameter tapering, backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_051_dichotomous_tree_branching.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
